Generate a game-ready LOW RESOLUTION PIXEL ART sprite sheet, not an illustration. spr-lia-read attempt 2. Output 1536x1024 landscape, EXACT 4 columns x 2 rows. Think of the entire sheet as a 192x128 pixel canvas enlarged exactly 8x with nearest-neighbour; each invisible cell is 48x64 logical pixels (384x512 output pixels). EVERY mark is a solid square 8x8 output pixel block. No subpixel details, no anti-alias, no smooth areas, NO gradients. Use at most 24 flat muted colors. Mandatory BACKGROUND: one single opaque uniform pure #FF00FF RGB(255,0,255) color covering ALL empty pixels, absolutely no shadow, light pool, vignette, glow, texture or alpha haze. No cell lines or labels.
Reference 1 sets the pixel RPG style and slightly elevated 3/4 camera only; film references 2-4 define costume and hair. Same slender teenage Lia, natural realistic small head (~6.5 head heights standing), eyes each 1-2 dark logical pixels, no large blue anime eyes. Light brown to dark blonde braided hair with a few summer-gold pixels, side braids gathered at the back, gathered ivory blouse with loose sleeves, long beige mustard skirt, dark braided brown belt. No cloak. Brown leather book, plain ivory page block, no writing. Dark charcoal-brown 1 logical pixel outline. Palette #D6AD59 mustard-gold, #B59A67 skirt shadow, #E8E2D0 ivory, #B9B2A0 blouse shade, #392A23 leather and belt; natural warm skin. No magical effects. Recognizable quiet ending scene: Lia reads beneath an OFFSCREEN tree, shields eyes from evening sun, closes her book, rises and puts on wooden clogs. TREE MUST NOT BE DRAWN.
Strict row-major 8 poses:
r1c1 seated barefoot, back leaning against imagined absent tree, OPEN book on lap, eyes lowered reading; r1c2 SAME seated pose with one hand flat shading eyes, looking toward sun, open book remains on lap; r1c3 SAME seated pose both hands close leather book on lap; r1c4 stands upright barefoot holding closed book at left hip.
r2c1 bends forward slipping first foot into brown wooden clog, other foot bare, closed book under anatomical LEFT arm;
r2c2 bends forward slipping second foot into other brown wooden clog, first clog worn, closed book under SAME arm;
r2c3 SOUTH facing, upright relaxed, BOTH wooden clogs worn, CLOSED book snug under LEFT upper arm (viewer right), eyes looking forward;
r2c4 SOUTH facing same idle subtle breathing shoulders, BOTH clogs, SAME book under SAME arm.
Center every pose at logical x24 within cell, grounded at local y60, preserve exact same anatomy scale and clothing from frame to frame. Standing head at y10, body ~50 logical pixels tall. Seated heads naturally lower. No adjacent-cell overlap. Full figure and props within cell with minimum 4 logical pixel margin. No photorealism, no painterly shading, no chibi, no anime, no scene, no floor, no shadows, no text, no grid. Uniform PURE MAGENTA empty space is essential.
